use paigasus_helikon_runtime_axum::{EventLog, RunRegistry};

// A2A taskId  <-- mapped onto --  runtime-axum run id
// A2A TaskState <-- derived from -- terminal AgentEvent
// A2A artifacts <-- rebuilt from  -- replayed event log

+ No new abstraction; one replay implementation
+ Already battle-tested by the /events WebSocket

- EventLog is keyed by run id and knows nothing
  of submitted/input-required/canceled
- Couples the A2A wire contract to another
  crate's internal shape; changes there ripple
- Would likely need runtime-axum API changes
  (= a manual version bump there too)

